  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "オカルトざっしが　しょうかいしたうちゅうじんが　おくりこんできた！\u0004\u0006科学兵器かがくへいき科学兵器に　よく　にている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오컬트 잡지에서 소개된 적 있는 우주인이 보낸 과학 병기와 많이 닮았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與超自然雜誌裡介紹的外星人送來的科學兵器長得極為相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble beaucoup à une arme sophistiquée qui serait d’origine extraterrestre, selon une revue consacrée aux phénomènes paranormaux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ähnelt stark einer wissenschaftlichen Waffe, die einer esoterischen Zeitschrift zufolge von Außerirdischen auf den Planeten geschickt wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su aspecto recuerda al de un arma científica de origen extraterrestre que apareció en un artículo de una revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Somiglia molto a un’arma ad alta tecnologia che, secondo una rivista di paranormale, sarebbe stata inviata qui dagli alieni.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon closely resembles a scientific weapon that a paranormal magazine claimed was sent to this planet by aliens.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "オカルト雑誌が　紹介した宇宙人が　送り込んできた！\u0004\u0006科学兵器かがくへいき科学兵器に　よく　似ている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "它与超自然杂志中所介绍的外星人送来的科学兵器十分相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su aspecto recuerda al de un arma científica de origen extraterrestre que apareció en un artículo de una revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きんねん　もくげきれいが　ある。ふるい　たんけんきに　しるされたなぞの　ぶったいに　にた　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "근년에 목격된 사례가 있다. 오래된 탐험기에 기록된 정체불명의 물체를 닮은 포켓몬.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "近年曾經有人目擊到牠。是與古老的探險記裡記載的不明物體長得很像的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon a été aperçu à plusieurs reprises ces dernières années. Il ressemble à une mystérieuse entité évoquée dans un vieux récit d’exploration.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In den letzten Jahren gab es Sichtungen dieses Pokémon. Ein alter Expeditionsbericht erwähnt ein mysteriöses Objekt, dem es ähnelt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se han constatado avistamientos en los últimos años. Su aspecto se asemeja al de un misterioso objeto descrito en un diario antiguo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Alcuni riportano di averlo avvistato negli ultimi anni. Somiglia a un oggetto misterioso descritto in un antico diario di viaggio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sightings of this Pokémon have occurred in recent years. It resembles a mysterious object described in an old expedition journal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "近年　目撃例が　ある。古い　探検記に　記された謎の　物体に　似た　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "近年有人目击到它。是与古老的探险记中记载的不明物体长得很像的宝可梦。",
